Description: C17 network daemon, JavaFX controller, and terminal dashboard
 clambhook provides a C17 network client daemon, frozen HTTP/WebSocket control
 API, a self-contained JavaFX/Gluon native controller, a terminal dashboard,
 and the license helper used for trial and license activation.
